    Player: "French Dominoes is a cut-throat domino game from the Caribbean (particularly Jamaica) featuring a distinctive cross-shaped tile layout. Played with a double-six domino set, it requires players to form a cross pattern with tiles before extending outward, combining careful strategy with luck. The game emphasizes blocking opponents while emptying one's own hand.",
