            title: 'FRENCH DOMINOES',
            subtitle: 'The Caribbean Cross Game',
            tagline: 'Form the cross. Block your opponents. Race to empty your hand.',
          },
          shortDescription: 'A Jamaican domino game featuring strategic cross-layout play where four players compete to empty their hands while accumulating the fewest penalty points.',
          uiThemes: [
