            winner_final_double_no_doubles_held: "Triple other players' scores",
            winner_final_double_opponents_hold_doubles: "Quadruple other players' scores",
          },
          splitRules: "Each player's unplayed dominoes are tallied and added to their cumulative score. First player reaching 100+ points is eliminated. Game continues until one player remains or mutual agreement.",
